    "description": "Overlooking a beach on the Caribbean Sea, this luxe resort is 4 km from the 18th-century Fort George and 6 km from Maurice Bishop International Airport.\nFeaturing floor-to-ceiling windows, wood floors and original artwork, the airy, elegant rooms provide Wi-Fi access, flat-screen TVs and minibars. The 1- to 3-bedroom suites add living areas, kitchens, and terraces with sea views. Lavish villas have private pools. Room service is available 24/7.\nA breakfast buffet is available. There's also a relaxed open-air eatery, a sleek Pan-Asian restaurant and a cigar lounge, plus an outdoor pool, and a spa with a gym."
